    a: "A programmatic JV is a standing agreement between a capital partner and an operator to invest in a series of deals on pre-agreed terms, up to a set amount of equity. Each deal still needs the LP's approval, but economics and governance are settled once. The operator gets reliable capital; the LP gets repeat access to a proven operator's pipeline.",
